title: "Dubai Lead Desk: who kept buying homes in Dubai since 28 February 2026"
abstract: "An analysis of Dubai Land Department open data (472,404 residential sales, January 2024 to 19 October 2026): the pace of sales against the usual pattern by month and price band, same-building prices, rents and off-plan supply, a November 2026 forecast written down in advance, and a free n8n tool that answers buyer enquiries."
